WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.078
The purpose of my program is to have the monkey catch

2
00:00:03.078 --> 00:00:04.240
the falling bananas.

3
00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:07.893
My code works by using events in this part to start

4
00:00:07.893 --> 00:00:10.827
everything. When the green flag is clicked, the reset

5
00:00:10.827 --> 00:00:13.705
block puts the monkey at his starting spot. Then the

6
00:00:13.705 --> 00:00:16.030
broadcast block tells the banana to reset.

7
00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:20.410
Over on the banana, when it gets that message, the reset

8
00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:23.380
block puts it at the top. Then the forever block keeps

9
00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:26.460
changing y by negative twenty five, so it falls a little

10
00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:27.010
at a time.

11
00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:30.941
When the right arrow key is pressed, he moves ten steps

12
00:00:30.941 --> 00:00:31.660
to the right.

13
00:00:32.530 --> 00:00:35.450
And when the left arrow key is pressed, he moves

14
00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:38.370
negative ten steps, so he goes back to the left.

15
00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:43.599
When the monkey touches the banana, the broadcast block

16
00:00:43.599 --> 00:00:46.750
sends reset banana, so the banana goes back up to the

17
00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:48.890
top. Because he ate it, he says yum.

18
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:56.037
And it also uses events in this part to tell the monkey

19
00:00:56.037 --> 00:00:59.074
he missed. When the banana touches the green grass, the

20
00:00:59.074 --> 00:01:01.890
broadcast block sends missed banana, and the banana

21
00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:03.160
resets back to the top.

22
00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:11.414
When the monkey gets that message, he says, no, I missed

23
00:01:11.414 --> 00:01:11.990
a banana.

24
00:01:13.830 --> 00:01:16.691
If I were to change this event like this, for example

25
00:01:16.691 --> 00:01:19.607
changing the right arrow to the space key, the program

26
00:01:19.607 --> 00:01:22.468
would run differently. Pressing the right arrow would

27
00:01:22.468 --> 00:01:25.275
not do anything anymore, so he would only move right

28
00:01:25.275 --> 00:01:28.136
when I pressed the space bar. So the key in the event

29
00:01:28.136 --> 00:01:29.270
block really matters.

